Business Logic, modular take (Bounded contexts)

ex:

Discussion/                               # Module
├── Foundry.Discussion.Domain/          # aggregate roots, repository interfaces
├── Foundry.Discussion.Application/     # CreatePostCommand, GetPostsQuery
├── Foundry.Discussion.Infrastructure/  # DiscussionDbContext, repository impl
└── Foundry.Discussion.Api/             # Api controllers (endpoints)